# Maze Of Words

2D FillWord puzzle (Cocos Creator **3.8.8**, web / Yandex Games). Find one main word on a letter grid; bonus words (4+ letters in the dictionary) are optional.

## Where to look

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Gameplay scripts | `assets/code/` | Pipeline features, level flow, UI, ads/config |
| Level logic | `assets/code/level/` | Grid, input, generator, next-level |
| Portable helpers | `assets/code/self contained/` | Storage, Yandex SDK, popups, tweens, RNG — **no game coupling** |
| Scene / prefabs | `assets/node/` | Editor wiring (`main.scene`, cell/popup prefabs) |
| Word dictionaries | `assets/level/words/words_all_{locale}.txt` | Bundle `words`, loaded at runtime |
| Music | `assets/media/music/` | Bundle `music`, shuffled BGM |
| Build HTML | `build-templates/web-mobile/index.ejs` | Loads `/sdk.js`, sets `YG` / `YG_Player` / `YG_Lang` |
| Product intent | `README.md` | Goals, architecture, roadmap |

Ignore / never commit: `library/`, `temp/`, `local/`, `build/`, `profiles/` (regenerated by Creator).

## Agent defaults

- Prefer extending the **pipeline + events** pattern over new global singletons (`Audio` / `Toast` / `PopupManager` already exist).
- Keep `@ccclass` names stable; scene/prefab references use script UUID from `.meta`.
- Do not invent class/method inventories in docs — describe flows and ownership instead.
- Match existing style: optional chaining for pipeline hooks, `==` for nullish checks, minimal comments.
- Tunable constants live in `Config` (Remote Config can override); do not hardcode hint cost / cooldowns / level bands elsewhere.
- RNG: use `self contained/Rand` (mulberry32). Do **not** call Cocos `math.pseudoRandom*` with `seed++` — consecutive seeds correlate badly.
- Do not run `assets/level/converter.py` unless asked (needs local Wiktionary dumps).
